            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "India Releases First Funds Under Rs 1 Lakh Crore RDI Scheme, Backing Five Deep Tech Startups",
            "articleSection": "Discovery & Research",
            "abstract": "The Indian government has disbursed the first cheques under its Rs 1 lakh crore Research, Development and Innovation Fund, selecting five deep tech startups working across space, robotics, batteries, drones, and advanced healthcare. This marks a significant milestone in India's push to translate state capital into frontier technology development. The RDI Scheme is one of the largest government-backed innovation funding mechanisms in India's history.",
